o estar\u00e1 protegido para que puedas sacar el m\u00e1ximo partido a tu Galaxy sin preocuparte por nada!<\/p><ul><li><strong>Procesador<\/strong><\/li><li>Velocidad CPU<\/li><li>2.2GHz, 1.8GHz<\/li><li>Tipo CPU<\/li><li>Octa-Core<\/li><li><strong>Pantalla<\/strong><\/li><li>Tama\u00f1o<\/li><li>11.0' (278.2mm)<\/li><li>Resoluci\u00f3n<\/li><li>1920 x 1200 (WUXGA)<\/li><li>Tecnolog\u00eda<\/li><li>TFT<\/li><li>N\u00famero de colores<\/li><li>16M<\/li><li><strong>C\u00e1mara<\/strong><\/li><li>C\u00e1mara principal - Resoluci\u00f3n<\/li><li>8.0 MP<\/li><li>C\u00e1mara principal - Autofocus<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li>C\u00e1mara frontal - Resoluci\u00f3n<\/li><li>5.0 MP<\/li><li>C\u00e1mara principal - Flash<\/li><li>No<\/li><li>Resoluci\u00f3n de grabaci\u00f3n de v\u00eddeo<\/li><li>FHD (1920 x 1080)@30fps<\/li><li><strong>Almacenamiento\/Memoria<\/strong><\/li><li>Memoria_(GB)<\/li><li>4<\/li><li>Almacenamiento (GB)<\/li><li>64<\/li><li>Soporte de almacenamiento externo<\/li><li>MicroSD (hasta 1TB)<\/li><li><strong>Redes\/Bandas<\/strong><\/li><li>2G GSM<\/li><li>GSM850, GSM900, DCS1800, PCS1900<\/li><li>3G UMTS<\/li><li>B1(2100), B2(1900), B4(AWS), B5(850), B8(900)<\/li><li>4G FDD LTE<\/li><li>B1(2100), B2(1900), B3(1800), B4(AWS), B5(850), B7(2600), B8(900), B12(700), B13(700), B17(700), B20(800), B26(850), B28(700), B66(AWS-3)<\/li><li>4G TDD LTE<\/li><li>B38(2600), B40(2300), B41(2500)<\/li><li>5G FDD Sub6<\/li><li>N1(2100), N3(1800), N5(850), N7(2600), N8(900), N20(800), N28(700), N66(AWS-3)<\/li><li>5G TDD Sub6<\/li><li>N38(2600), N40(2300), N41(2500), N77(3700), N78(3500)<\/li><li><strong>Conectividad<\/strong><\/li><li>Versi\u00f3n USB<\/li><li>USB 2.0<\/li><li>Localizaci\u00f3n<\/li><li>GPS, Glonass, Beidou, Galileo, QZSS<\/li><li>Auriculares<\/li><li>3.5mm Stereo<\/li><li>MHL<\/li><li>No<\/li><li>Wi-Fi<\/li><li>802.11 a\/b\/g\/n\/ac 2.4G+5GHz, VHT80<\/li><li>Wi-Fi Direct<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li>Versi\u00f3n Bluetooth<\/li><li>Bluetooth v5.1<\/li><li>Pe